sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Supplier
    participant G as API gateway
    participant A as Supplier Booking API
    participant R as Read model
    S->>G: GET /v1/bookings?since=cursor and limit=200 with bearer token
    G->>G: validate token, extract supplier_id, check token bucket
    G->>A: forward with supplier_id from token, not from query
    A->>R: select where supplier_id = X and version greater than cursor order by version limit 200
    R-->>A: rows plus highest version seen
    A-->>G: 200 with bookings[] and next_cursor, ETag set
    G-->>S: response
    Note over S,R: Next call sends next_cursor. A booking amended later reappears with a higher version, supplier upserts by booking_id.
